# Steam does not read .gitignore at all. SteamUGC.SetItemContent takes the junction's target
# directory exactly as it stands on disk, with no filtering, so anything sitting in the published
# folder is published. That is what `Mod/` is for: the junction points there, and the docs and
# this file stay out of reach by construction.

# Claude Code session worktrees and local settings.
.claude/

# Showcase briefs: working notes in French, written to be deleted once the two images exist.
PROMPT_*.md

